{"version":2,"sourceHash":"1822d08b1cf0edd0475c92c0afa22fe040cec6e8e632f2e40817de52b7dfdd2e","locale":"zh-CN","id":"ep-52","no":"EP.52","tag":"第52话 · 樱花河畔的约定","title":"樱花河畔的约定","rev":2,"branch":"reality","beats":[{"s":"n","t":"回信在三天后凌晨到了。她看见1消失，险些从床滚下。","bg":"room","bgm":"daily","id":"ep-52:reply-1","scene":{"background":"room","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: room","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"room 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"sys","t":"［ 短信 · Park Byeongha：屏坏了，现在才看见。周四四点，东边长椅。不会迟 ］","id":"ep-52:reply-2"},{"id":"ep-52:1","s":"n","t":"周四。一下课，Yeoni就推着自行车往河边去。手机地图上标着和Byeongha约好的长椅。离约定还有半小时。","bg":"river","bgm":"flowingLight","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"think"},"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"water","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:2","s":"n","t":"在第一座桥旁走错了路，Yeoni调转车头往河边下去。明明还没迟到，却不停看时间。"},{"id":"ep-52:3","s":"yeon","t":"半小时明明够用，怎么每看一眼，时间都往前跑了。","x":"disappoint"},{"id":"ep-52:4","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用消息 · Kang Saebyeok：确认长椅位置了吗？花落了，约定也不会落。慢慢来，咨询费以后再说 ]","im":true,"sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:5","s":"yeon","t":"帮忙传号码是很感谢，但为什么要咨询费？走错路能退款吗？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-52:6","s":"n","t":"嘴上这么说，Yeoni还是踩着踏板。今天她故意穿了不成对的袜子，左脚黄色，右脚条纹。"},{"id":"ep-52:7","s":"yeon","t":"他肯定又先看袜子。听见那句唠叨，我应该也能像平时一样说话了。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:8","s":"n","t":"早上挑袜子时，Yeoni反复练习见面的第一句话。“我想你了”却始终说不出口。她希望不成对的袜子能替她说。"},{"id":"ep-52:9","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用消息 · Moka：今天见面吧？说不出话就放我的说唱，气氛可不保证 ]","sfx":"chime"},{"id":"ep-52:10","s":"yeon","t":"这哪是打气，分明是捣乱。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:11","s":"n","t":"河风卷走花瓣，Yeoni放慢了踩踏。比起迷路，她更担心一看见他的脸就哭出来。"},{"id":"ep-52:12","s":"yeon","t":"花落了，以后再来就好。今天没说出口的话，下次也能说。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:13","s":"n","t":"Yeoni握紧车把。掌心正中微微发暖，是那片金曾停留的位置。"},{"id":"ep-52:14","s":"n","t":"四点前，她到了约好的长椅。停自行车时手一滑，车倒向草地。Yeoni慌忙低头翻包，掩饰自己的紧张。","bg":"bench","bgm":"teaHouse","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"disappoint"},"c":null,"r":null,"sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:15","s":"yeon","t":"路明明找对了，怎么故障的是我。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:16","s":"n","t":"笔记本顶端写着四点、河边长椅。下面Park Byeongha旁，她又小小地补了一个Neo。看见熟悉的名字，呼吸慢慢平稳下来。"},{"id":"ep-52:17","s":"yeon","t":"先叫他的名字就好了，像以前一样。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-52:18","s":"n","t":"正要合上本子，一片花瓣落在纸页间。Yeoni没有拂去，就让它夹在里面。"},{"id":"ep-52:19","s":"n","t":"这时，长椅另一端传来喷嚏声。Yeoni转过头。"},{"id":"ep-52:20","s":"n","t":"一把白伞倚着长椅，旁边坐着个男人，膝上摊着书，脚边蜷着一只流浪猫。","im":true,"sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:21","s":"neo","t":"啊，抱歉。我对猫过敏。","x":"hneutral","r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"}},{"id":"ep-52:22","s":"yeon","t":"那怎么不赶走它？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-52:23","s":"neo","t":"它先坐在这里的。是它的位置。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:24","s":"n","t":"男人银发在河风中凌乱，发间露出冷淡眉眼。他只点头，像初见她。"},{"id":"ep-52:25","s":"n","t":"她屏息。是船上第一次牵手的人，如今却在装不认识。"},{"id":"ep-52:26","s":"neo","t":"你的自行车倒了。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:27","s":"yeon","t":"啊，嗯，我知道。故意的。","x":"shock"},{"id":"ep-52:28","s":"neo","t":"头一次见有人故意让车倒下。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:29","s":"n","t":"男人垂眼继续看书，随后又停住。视线落在Yeoni的脚踝，黄色袜子与条纹袜子之间。","bg":"bench","shot":"close","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"shy"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:30","s":"neo","t":"那个，你的袜子不成对。","x":"hpoint","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"bench","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: bench","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"bench 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:31","s":"n","t":"三秒，陌生人演技到此。她咬唇，男人一脸失策地合书。"},{"id":"ep-52:32","s":"neo","t":"……本想装不认识。让袜子坏事了。","x":"hache"},{"id":"ep-52:33","s":"yeon","t":"三秒都没忍住。演技一星。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:34","s":"neo","t":"看到你贴车窗的手掌。跑了，没追上。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:35","s":"yeon","t":"那至少挥手啊。我下一站就下车跑了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-52:36","s":"n","t":"Byeongha抿紧嘴唇，一副笑着笑着就要哭出来的表情。看着他的脸，Yeoni也忍不住笑了。"},{"id":"ep-52:37","s":"neo","t":"所以今天早来，一个小时。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:38","s":"yeon","t":"一小时？那刚才的戏也练了一小时？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-52:39","s":"neo","t":"练十分钟就够了，余下是猫不肯让位。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:40","s":"yeon","t":"别说敬语，起鸡皮疙瘩。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-52:41","s":"neo","t":"有点可惜。知道了。","x":"hsmile"},{"id":"ep-52:42","s":"n","t":"Byeongha有些难为情地揉了揉太阳穴。看着那个熟悉的动作，Yeoni终于放松了肩膀。"},{"id":"ep-52:43","s":"n","t":"Byeongha扶起自行车交给Yeoni，她把车把的一侧留给他。两人配合着步子走向河边，不必再匆忙寻找彼此了。","bg":"cherryDay","bgm":"neo2","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hcalm"},"fx":"stars","sfx":"sparkle","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"stars","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:44","s":"n","t":"樱花道沿河延伸很远。花瓣随风飞起，落在两人肩上，是最后的几片花瓣了。"},{"id":"ep-52:45","s":"neo","t":"一周内向三只猫问路，都只让我打喷嚏就走。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:46","s":"yeon","t":"为什么问猫。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:47","s":"neo","t":"以为能说通话。习惯真可怕。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:48","s":"yeon","t":"难怪袖上有白毛。Saebyeok说的。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:49","s":"neo","t":"那算命的连别人袖子也看？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:50","s":"yeon","t":"他看手相，手旁边都看。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:51","s":"neo","t":"今天掸过袖子，查吧。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:52","s":"yeon","t":"查了，剩一根，白的。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:53","s":"n","t":"他这才笑出声，她也止不住笑。一片花瓣落在他银发间。"},{"id":"ep-52:54","s":"yeon","t":"重新介绍一次？不藏名字。","x":"serious","bg":"cherryDay","shot":"close","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-52:55","s":"neo","t":"我叫Park Byeongha。您呢？","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:56","s":"n","t":"Park Byeongha。Yeoni在心里轻轻念了一遍。第一次在恋人牌上读到的名字，那个据说一叫出口，他就会消失的名字。"},{"id":"ep-52:57","s":"n","t":"现在叫出名字，他也不会消失了。Yeoni写下的卡牌已把名字和记忆归还主人。她想在现实中也亲口确认这一点。"},{"id":"ep-52:58","s":"yeon","t":"不过，还有我给你起的名字呢。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:59","s":"n","t":"她摇头。有另一个该叫的名字，在空亡中，靠一纸笔记，把被忘光的人唤回的名字。"},{"id":"ep-52:60","s":"yeon","t":"我叫Yeoni。还有，能拜托你一件事吗？","x":"gentle","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:61","s":"neo","t":"什么事？","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:62","s":"yeon","t":"从现在，用我起的名字叫。立刻答我。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-52:63","s":"yeon","t":"Neo。","x":"cry","bg":"cherryDay","bgm":"starsName","shot":"impact","fx":"reveal","sfx":"bell","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"cry"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hneutral"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"reveal","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-52:64","s":"n","t":"风停了。正落下的花瓣仿佛在半空稍作停留。Park Byeongha停下脚步。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"chime","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:65","s":"neo","t":"啊。","x":"hache"},{"id":"ep-52:66","s":"n","t":"他低看手。名字被唤出，指尖却不透明，像确认般握拳、松开两次。"},{"id":"ep-52:67","s":"n","t":"第一滴雨落下，河面一圈、两圈漾开。"},{"id":"ep-52:68","s":"n","t":"她取出缠三层胶带的黄伞撑开，向他偏一半，左肩渐湿。","im":true,"fx":"thread","sfx":"sparkle","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"thread","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:69","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:70","s":"yeon","t":"嗯，是我，穿错袜子的那个。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-52:71","s":"neo","t":"肩湿了，给我。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:72","s":"n","t":"玩笑般的客套话结束了。直率，带点傲气，尾音却莫名温柔。那是她一路都想听见的语气。"},{"id":"ep-52:73","s":"yeon","t":"不要，今天我撑。","x":"determined"},{"id":"ep-52:74","s":"neo","t":"还是这么固执。","x":"hsmile"},{"id":"ep-52:75","s":"n","t":"他的手裹住她握伞的手，伞回到两人正中。这一次，身体哪里都没模糊。","bg":"cherryDay","shot":"wide","sfx":"none","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hsmile"},"scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"s":"neo","t":"……没错过。","x":"hcalm","id":"ep-52:f029"},{"id":"ep-52:76","s":"neo","t":"手不透明。这样抱着……也可以吧？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:77","s":"yeon","t":"头，摸头就好。这个你会吧。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:78","s":"neo","t":"还有，Yeoni，袜子怎么又不成对？","x":"harms"},{"id":"ep-52:79","s":"yeon","t":"这是测试。你通过了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:80","s":"n","t":"跟在脚边的流浪猫喵了一声。Park Byeongha打了个喷嚏，Yeoni笑出了声。"},{"id":"ep-52:81","s":"neo","t":"偏偏这过敏没变。回来时就不能顺便治一下吗？得给客服打个电话。","x":"hneutral"},{"id":"ep-52:82","s":"yeon","t":"给客服投诉吧。排队只有一个人，很快就能接通。","x":"happy"},{"id":"ep-52:83","s":"yeon","t":"回来以后，记忆也一直都在吧？作为Byeongha生活的日子，还有作为Neo的日子，都在吧？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:84","s":"neo","t":"都记得。上班、交房租的Byeongha，陪在你身边的Neo，还有船上你握住的那只手。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:85","s":"neo","t":"奇怪，一点也不会混乱。大概因为，两个都是我。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:86","s":"yeon","t":"那怎么叫你？Byeongha？Neo？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:87","s":"neo","t":"叫你起的名字，Neo。在公司叫Byeongha，免得解释太久。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:88","s":"yeon","t":"本来没打算去你公司。现在有了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-52:89","s":"n","t":"Byeongha笑了，一边嘴角先翘起来，笑得有点笨拙。Yeoni觉得，这个表情自己不会再忘了。","im":true,"fx":"heart","sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"cherryDay","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: cherryDay","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"cherryDay 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:90","s":"n","t":"夕阳倾向河面，花瓣漂在水上，缓缓流去。两人并肩倚着河畔栏杆。","bg":"river","bgm":"firstLight","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"happy"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"neo","x":"hsmile"},"sfx":"water","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-52:91","s":"neo","t":"第一场春天，说过一起走这路，没走成。","x":"hspeak"},{"id":"ep-52:92","s":"yeon","t":"那场春天的我们，想做什么？不会吵架吧？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:93","s":"neo","t":"什么也不做，就走走。架走完再吵。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:94","s":"yeon","t":"那就约好，每年春天都来这里走走。花落之前，什么也不做。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:95","s":"neo","t":"约定就是用来守的，伞轮流撑。","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:96","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用通知 · 徐寒雨：看海定在五月第二个星期六。可以再带一位，别带掉毛的那位 ]","im":true,"sfx":"chime","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"river","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: river","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"river 배경에서 진행되는 시스템 메시지"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-52:97","s":"neo","t":"早就不掉毛了，怎么还说这事？","x":"hpoint"},{"id":"ep-52:98","s":"yeon","t":"你还打喷嚏啊。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:99","s":"n","t":"Yeoni回复：加一位。人类。不掉毛。负责检查袜子。"},{"s":"neo","t":"海是第一次。那场春天终究没去成。","x":"hsoft","id":"ep-52:sea-1"},{"s":"yeon","t":"那饭卷你来卷。破肚给一星。","x":"happy","id":"ep-52:sea-2"},{"id":"ep-52:100","s":"sys","t":"[ 应用通知 · Kang Saebyeok：找到了吧。今日运势算准了，现收取咨询费。另外，请问他的出生时辰 ]","sfx":"chime"},{"id":"ep-52:101","s":"neo","t":"这人怎么还问出生时辰？","x":"hpoint"},{"id":"ep-52:102","s":"yeon","t":"想看看咱俩合不合。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-52:103","s":"neo","t":"我们有乙庚合就够了。不是一起走到这里了吗？","x":"hcalm"},{"id":"ep-52:104","s":"yeon","t":"可还是会好奇呀，能打几分。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-52:105","s":"neo","t":"不到一百分，别再见那算命的。","x":"hsmile"},{"id":"ep-52:106","s":"n","t":"Yeoni笑着把手机放回口袋，牵起Park Byeongha的手。人的手比想象中大，也比想象中凉一点。"},{"id":"ep-52:107","s":"yeon","t":"手好凉。因为是庚金吗？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-52:108","s":"neo","t":"是你的手暖，因为是乙木。","x":"hsoft"},{"id":"ep-52:109","s":"n","t":"两人牵着手沿河走去。流浪猫远远跟在后面，Park Byeongha又打了个喷嚏。最后一片花瓣，顺着河水流远。"}]}
